ci_gate check-requirement-status
  stage rust
  description "The generated status ledger covers the exact assembled requirement set, and an implemented verdict always names an on-disk automated test."
  run "rust-script scripts/generate-requirement-status.rs && rust-script scripts/check-requirement-status.rs"
  justification "A status ledger that drifts from the assembled requirement set means a requirement can appear delivered when it is still open, or vice versa; the gate was introduced in #1138 (commit 9c31b0530) to keep the ledger synchronized."
